  "question": {
    "text": "The slope of the tangent to the curve <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>54</mn></math> which also passes through the origin is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "28",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> be the point on this curve such that the tangent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> passes through the origin.</p><p>Equation of tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br />It passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />So, <math><msub><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math></p>"
  }
}